    {
        "model": "campaign_trail.question",
        "pk": 12871,
        "fields": {
            "priority": 0,
            "description": "For nearly 8 years now, the Blair-Brown Pact has manifested itself in the form of Chancellor of the Exchequer, Gordon Brown, containing an unprecedented influence over economic policy. Although no tensions have simmered over publicly between the two of you, rumours of them persist nonetheless. In light of this, would you like to have Brown on with you during the campaign trail?",
