            "description": "As the campaign trudges along, the Conservatives have begun to ramp up increasingly personal attacks on the trail. Their charges centre around your alleged misleading of the public over the conduct of the war in the Middle East, and the tax rises in the second-term budgets. You are not going to let this stand.",
