    {
        "model": "campaign_trail.question",
        "pk": 14399,
        "fields": {
            "priority": 0,
            "description": "Your mind is abound with dreams and possibilities about the future you wish to build for Britain, social justice, justice for the low paid. There is an incredulous agenda you feel compelled to begin work on. But before all of that, lies the responsibility of making your first big speech outside of No. 10. The eyes of the world are upon you, Gordon, how will you placate their desire?",
