    {
        "model": "campaign_trail.question",
        "pk": 14296,
        "fields": {
            "priority": 0,
            "description": "Hague, Smith, and Howard are not leaders of the Tories. The centre has now been left open for the taking, Portillo is now honing in on your supposed ballooning of the state in public utilities, contrasting it with a failure to move the country forward on the rights of same-sex couples. According to him, you’re no longer New Labour – you are nothing more than a standard tax-and-spend Labour politician. But you <i>are</i> New Labour, so prove him wrong.",
